{"ticker":"JPM","updated":"2026-11-27T23:02:55Z","profile":{"longName":"JPMorgan Chase & Co.","shortName":"JP Morgan Chase & Co.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Diversified","country":"United States","website":"https://www.jpmorganchase.com","fullTimeEmployees":322964,"marketCap":857655672832,"trailingPE":13.546979,"forwardPE":12.628915,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.4966297,"pegRatio":1.55,"targetMeanPrice":373.65216,"targetHighPrice":425.0,"targetLowPrice":312.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.102,"earningsGrowth":0.099,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.44787997,"profitMargins":0.34592,"totalRevenue":190732992512,"beta":1.02,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":366.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":279.1,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.08},"summary":"JPMorgan Chase & Co. operates as a bank and financial holding company in the United States, rest of North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, Latin America, and the Caribbean. It operates in three segments: Consumer & Community Banking, Commercial & Investment Bank, and Asset & Wealth Management. The company offers deposit, investment and lending products, and cash management; mortgage origination and servicing activities; residential mortgages and home equity loans; and credit cards, payment solutions, travel services, merchant offers, lifestyle benefits, auto loans, and leases to consumers and small businesses through bank branches, ATMs, and digital and telephone banking. It also provides investment banking, market-making, financing, custody, and securities products and services; corporate strategy and structure advisory, equity and debt market capital-raising, and loan origination and syndication services; cash and derivative instruments, risk management solutions, prime brokerage, clearing, and research; and fund services, liquidity and trading services, and data solutions products for large corporations, financial institutions, merchants, start-ups, small and midsized companies, local governments, municipalities, nonprofits, and commercial real estate clients. In addition, the company offers multi-asset investment management solutions in equities, ","summary_zh":"摩根大通公司是一家銀行和金融控股公司，業務遍及美國、北美其他地區、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區、拉丁美洲和加勒比海地區。該公司分為三個業務部門：消費者與社區銀行業務、商業與投資銀行業務、資產與財富管理業務。該公司提供存款、投資和貸款產品以及現金管理；抵押貸款發放和服務活動；住宅抵押貸款和房屋淨值貸款；透過銀行分行、ATM 機以及數位和電話銀行向消費者和小型企業提供信用卡、支付解決方案、旅行服務、商家優惠、生活方式福利、汽車貸款和租賃。它還提供投資銀行、做市、融資、託管和證券產品和服務；企業策略和結構諮詢、股權和債務市場融資以及貸款發放和銀團服務；現金和衍生工具、風險管理解決方案、大宗經紀、清算和研究；為大型企業、金融機構、商家、新創企業、中小企業、地方政府、市政當局、非營利組織和商業客戶提供服務基金服務、企業、新創公司、企業、地方政府、市政當局、非營利組織和商業客戶提供服務。此外，該公司也提供股票等多元資產投資管理解決方案，","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 多元化","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":317.06,"h":318.01,"l":313.66,"c":315.69,"v":6462400},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":316.25,"h":317.41,"l":310.11,"c":315.43,"v":11823300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":313.97,"h":314.59,"l":307.41,"c":310.71,"v":9235200},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":310.0,"h":310.56,"l":306.14,"c":307.55,"v":7600000},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":308.51,"h":311.66,"l":308.21,"c":310.03,"v":6029900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":310.18,"h":311.75,"l":305.13,"c":309.18,"v":7214500},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":309.35,"h":310.01,"l":304.7,"c":307.69,"v":8454200},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":308.21,"h":308.78,"l":303.55,"c":304.03,"v":6489900},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":305.05,"h":308.04,"l":303.39,"c":305.53,"v":7060300},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":305.66,"h":310.47,"l":300.81,"c":300.89,"v":8597400},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":305.6,"h":309.46,"l":305.45,"c":307.97,"v":10788700},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":305.84,"h":307.0,"l":294.21,"c":302.08,"v":16178800},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":306.39,"h":312.12,"l":305.44,"c":305.69,"v":11354800},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":305.35,"h":308.68,"l":297.07,"c":298.54,"v":10549400},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":299.16,"h":299.55,"l":294.2,"c":297.56,"v":10153500},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":298.5,"h":303.69,"l":298.16,"c":302.36,"v":6894900},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":301.66,"h":304.05,"l":297.0,"c":297.09,"v":73727